skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam classBorderColor black
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageBorderColor transparent
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor black
skinparam nodesep 105
skinparam ranksep 75
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white

skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DDEEF9
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FBE4CF
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FBE4CF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DDF1ED
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #E0F0EE
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #DFEEF5
skinparam sequenceReferenceBackgroundColor #E0F1EC
skinparam sequenceReferenceHeaderBackgroundColor #D5EAE5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5DF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #DDF1ED
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #DDF1ED
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #DDEEF9

title 图47  角色授权分析序列图
actor 系统管理员 as A
boundary "<u>:账号管理接口</u>" as B
control "<u>:授权控制</u>" as C
participant "<u>:登录账号</u>" as K
participant "<u>:账号角色</u>" as R
participant "<u>:登录会话</u>" as S
participant "<u>:操作日志</u>" as L
A -> B : 提交目标账号、角色及批准依据
B -> C : 申请调整角色
C -> C : 校验操作者权限和禁止自行提权规则
C -> K : 核验身份、在岗及版本
C -> R : 校验角色适用条件并调整关联
C -> K : 递增授权版本
C -> S : 撤销旧会话
C -> L : 追加授权审计
note over C,L
以上写入同一事务；校验失败不修改任何授权。
临床角色须匹配牙医身份；业务负责人审批依据须留存。
end note
@enduml
